.","claim_ids":["c1","c3","c5","c8"]},{"text":"ITxBergen arrangerer årlige karrieredager for IT-studentene i Bergen, med formål å vise studentene bredden og mulighetene innen næringslivet i nærmiljøet og i Norge, samt å profilere studentene og fagmiljøet i Bergen for bedriftene.","claim_ids":["c10"]},{"text":"It was previously named ECHO KARRIERE until 2024-05-30.","claim_ids":["c21"]},{"text":"Its main industry code is 94.992: other activities of other membership organisations.","claim_ids":["c4"]},{"text":"It has 1 registered workplace.","claim_ids":["c34"]},{"text":"In its 2025 accounts, total operating income was 590 976 NOK and the annual result was 195 301 NOK; operating income was up from 522 921 NOK in 2024.","claim_ids":["c56","c61","c46"]},{"text":"The annual result rose from -54 NOK in 2024 to 195 301 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c50","c61"]},{"text":"Equity rose from 533 005 NOK in 2024 to 728 306 NOK in 2025.","claim_ids":["c53","c64"]},{"text":"Registered leadership: Brage Henden Nybakk (daglig leder and styrets leder), with 4 other board members.","claim_ids":["c27","c28","c29","c30","c31","c32"]},{"text":"Its verified website is itxbergen.no, which links to its Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn profiles.","claim_ids":["c70","c72","c73","c74"]},{"text":"The register's most recent update was on 2026-04-11 (aktivitet).","claim_ids":["c66"]}],"unknowns":["Employee count: The register shows no registered employee count for this entity.","Open positions (NAV): No active NAV job ad names this organisation number as employer (index built 2026-11-07T08:17:35+00:00).","Hiring: no open NAV job ads and no careers page on the verified website.","Dated news: none found on the verified website."],"writer":"template_v2+model_description"},"changes":[],"refresh":{"previous_run_id":null,"compared_at":"2026-11-07T08:45:31Z"},"errors":[],"operations":{"requests":11,"runtime_ms":11779,"third_party_cost_usd":0,"llm_calls":1},"snapshots":[{"source_url":"https://data.brreg.no/en